dsl metta

Concept Command as component

	Concept Status
		sub Visible
		sub Invisible
		sub Readonly

		has Condition	

	sub EditionCommand
		sub DraftEditing
			def word:{DirectUpdate EventDispatch} saveStrategy = DirectUpdate

	sub DocumentCommand
		sub Edit
		sub Sign > def string label = empty
		sub Seal

	sub CollectionCommand

		sub Download
			def string label
			def string downloadTitle = empty

			Concept:Required Column
				def string label
				def string tag

				facet ColumnType
					sub Link > def string value
					sub Term
					sub Text
					sub Number
					sub Check
						def string checkedValue = "Yes"
						def string uncheckedValue = "No"
					sub Date > def word:{Seconds Minutes Hours Days Months Years} resolution

				facet Inherited	
					def word:{Parent GrandParent} from

			Concept Format 
				facet Csv
				facet Tsv
				facet Xlsx > def resource template = empty
				facet Docx > def resource template = empty
				facet Pdf > def resource template = empty

		sub Filtering
			def string tag
			def string label
			def string defaultValue = empty

			facet FilteringType
				sub Date > def word:{Value Range} mode = Value
				sub Link 
					def word:{This All Root Parent GrandParent} scope = This
					def SubjectType subjectType
					def string value
			    sub Text

		sub Grouping
			def string tag
			def word:{Ascending Descending} mode = Ascending

			facet Type
				sub Text
				sub Date
					def word:{Seconds Minutes Hours Days Months Years} resolution

		sub Sorting
			def string tag
			def string label = empty
			def word:{Ascending Descending} mode = Ascending
			def word:{Number Text Date} type = Text
